{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38238","headline":"席上有赠 · 韩偓","name":"席上有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"矜严标格绝嫌猜，嗔怒虽逢笑靥开。\n小雁斜侵眉柳去，媚霞横接眼波来。\n鬓垂香颈云遮藕，粉着兰胷雪压梅。\n莫道风流无宋玉，好将心力事妆台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}